<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Coates lifts yr shr, div up.</title>
<headline>Coates lifts yr shr, div up.</headline>
<dateline>CAPE TOWN 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31, 1996</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)     44.0	  vs    41.5</p>
<p>    Final div (cts)	 11.5	  vs    10.5</p>
<p>    Attrib income	   15.39	 vs    14.49</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   24.15	 vs    23.48</p>
<p>    Tax			  8.59	 vs     8.93</p>
<p>    Interest paid	    2.86	 vs     1.49</p>
<p>    Interest received	0.24	 vs     0.09</p>
<p>    Turnover		 297.33	 vs   267.26</p>
<p>Div payable May 15</p>
<p>on register April 7</p>
<p>Full name: Coates</p>
<p>NOTE -  The group forecast moderate growth for its retail and manufacturing sectors but said it had budgeted to achieve real growth in the current year.</p>
<p>-- Cape Town newsroom +27 21 25-2238</p>
</text>
